{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108266","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108266/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108266/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108266/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108266","id":3201311003,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6-0CEb","number":108266,"title":"Custom resources with overridden constructors (with params) become null at runtime when exported","user":{"login":"migmoog","id":57271984,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjcxOTg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57271984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migmoog","html_url":"https://github.com/migmoog","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migmoog/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migmoog/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migmoog/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migmoog/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migmoog/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migmoog/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migmoog/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migmoog/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migmoog/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-07-04T04:38:21Z","updated_at":"2025-07-04T12:58:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nFound in 4.4.1 stable \n- Reproducible in 4.4 stable, 4.5 beta2 \n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.4.1 stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nExporting a custom resource in the editor turns it to null at runtime when its constructor is overridden. This applies to overridden constructors with parameters, but not parameterless ones.\n```gdscript\n\n# turns to null at runtime, regardless of type or annotations\nfunc _init(p_i: int) -> void:\n\tpass\n\n# this however causes no null\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tpass\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a script that extends `Resource` with a custom class name\n```gdscript\nclass_name CustomResource extends Resource\n\nfunc _init(p: int) -> void:\n  pass\n```\n2. In another node's script in a scene, export a var with the custom resource type.\n3. create a custom resource for the exported var in the editor\n4. in the ready function of the node add an assertion to check if it's null\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\n@export var cr: CustomResource\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n  assert(cr != null)\n```\n \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp_resource_overridden_constructor.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21050393/mrp_resource_overridden_constructor.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108266/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108266/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}